<title>NETHERLANDS: Diary of Dutch economic indicators for 1997.</title>
<headline>Diary of Dutch economic indicators for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) released the following provisional dates for publication of Dutch economic indicators in 1997:</p>
<p>GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT (GDP) PROVISIONAL</p>
<p>Q4 96 27/2, Q1 29/5, Q2 28/8, Q3 27/11</p>
<p>GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT (GDP) FINAL</p>
<p>Q3 96 30/1, Q4 96 24/4, Q1 24/7, Q2 30/10</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (CPI)</p>
<p>Dec 96 17/1, Jan 7/2, Feb 7/3, Mar 7/4, Apr 13/5, May 6/6, Jun 11/7, Jul 8/8, Aug 5/9, Sep 10/10, Oct 7/11, Nov 5/12</p>
<p>PRODUCER PRICE INDEX (PPI)</p>
<p>Nov 96 10/1, Dec 96 11/2, Jan 10/3, Feb 7/4, Mar 7/5, Apr 5/6, May 8/7, Jun 5/8, Jul 5/9, Aug 7/10, Sep 6/11, Oct 5/12</p>
<p>MANUFACTURING PRODUCTION</p>
<p>Nov 96 17/1, Dec 96 14/2, Jan 14/3, Feb 18/4, Mar 16/5, Apr 13/6, May 11/7, Jun 15/8, Jul/Aug 10/10, Sep 14/11, Oct 12/12</p>
<p>RETAIL SALES</p>
<p>Nov 96 13/1, Dec 96 31/1, Jan 10/3, Feb 7/4, Mar 2/5, Apr 2/6,</p>
<p>May 7/7, Jun 4/8, Jul 8/9, Aug 6/10, Sep 3/11, Oct 1/12</p>
<p>UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p>Dec 96 21/1, Jan 19/2, Feb 19/3, Mar 17/4, Apr 21/5, May 18/6,</p>
<p>Jun 17/7, Jul 19/8, Aug 17/9, Sep 16/10, Oct 19/11, Nov 17/12</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
